@startuml estados-transferencia-receptor
hide empty description
skinparam linetype spline
skinparam ArrowFontSize 9
skinparam nodesep 40
skinparam ranksep 38
[*] --> pending_new_receiver : el receptor actual\\npide la transferencia
pending_new_receiver --> completed : la invitada acepta\\n(cambio atómico de receptor)
pending_new_receiver --> rejected_by_new_receiver : la invitada rechaza
pending_new_receiver --> expired : vence el plazo
pending_new_receiver --> cancelled : el receptor la retira\\no empieza la entrega
state completed <<terminal>>
state rejected_by_new_receiver <<terminal>>
state expired <<terminal>>
state cancelled <<terminal>>
@enduml
